WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:03.120
You're going to force Himeragi to come out?

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:05.580
Like hell I'll let you do that!

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:08.500
Koukarin!

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:11.500
Come out! Al-Nasl-Minium!

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.440
Are you done already?

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.760
In that case... Now it's my turn.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.540
Popess!

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:29.220
Dammit... Come out, Mesarthim-Adamas!

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:37.100
Thanks for the save, Kirasaka!

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.460
What the hell is going on with his power?

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:41.820
It's the Cleansing.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:49.160
The Cleansing?

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:52.300
Do you remember Tokoyagi Aya's Dark Grimoire?

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:53.580
Of course.

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:56.520
It had the power to nullify magic and stuff, right?

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:01.640
That was a mere imitation of the Cleansing, and in truth, all it did was to overwrite phenomena.

00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:04.880
However, Meiga's power is the real thing.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:08.440
He can rewrite the world on a fundamental level.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:12.680
You can't win against him, even with your power.

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.180
Rewrite... the world?

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:05.000
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:06.460
You looked, didn't you!? I'll kill you!

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:08.420
That wasn't my fault!

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:11.500
Be on your guard.

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:15.980
His attacks will ignore the rules of both physics and magic.

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:18.700
How the hell am I supposed to guard against that!?

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:20.840
Koukarin!

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:24.820
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:28.100
I'm fine, it's just a scratch.

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.360
I'll recover from this in no time...

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:37.780
Well then, do you feel like summoning Himeragi Yukina yet?

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:39.640
Of course not!

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:42.520
Don't you dare speak Yukina's name-

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:48.420
Don't tell me...There's poison in the air...?

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:53.060
The power of the Cleansing allows the user to rewrite the world as they wish.

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:55.480
Something like this is trivial.

00:03:56.240 --> 00:04:00.780
I wonder if Himeragi Yukina will come out if she hears your screams?

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.180
Kirasaka...

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:05.420
Boyfriend-dono!

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.620
Lydianne...!

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:17.980
Take care of Kirasaka! Retreat to a safe place!

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:19.980
Understood!

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:21.660
Boyfriend-dono!

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:23.240
Akatsuki Kojou.

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:25.800
It's underground.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.180
Underground...?

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.480
I see!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.780
Come out, Natra-Cinereus!

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:50.160
So this is Cain's Coffin.

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:52.980
If I can just get Asagi out of there...!

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.860
Wait! Don't approach it carelessly!

00:04:58.420 --> 00:04:59.360
You fool!

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:08.220
...Himeragi?

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:11.060
Are you okay, Senpai?

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:13.520
Himeragi... What are you doing here?

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:21.000
So you finally came out, Himeragi Yukina!

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:23.900
Himeragi, be careful.

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:27.820
You might not be able to ward off his attacks, even with your spear.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:29.520
I know.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.300
Even so...

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:37.300
This divine energy... So I was right after all.

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:42.780
I will not allow you to trespass upon Touka's territory.

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:48.020
Touka was used up and thrown away just so that Sekkarou would have a new wielder...

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:51.460
There's no way I can accept something like that!

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:56.680
Minamiya-sensei! Hurry up and rescue Aiba-senpai!

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:59.660
I don't take orders from you, Sword Shaman!

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:03.540
Natsuki-chan!

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:09.060
I won't let you.

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:11.580
My thanks, Popess!

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:15.740
It's over, Himeragi Yukina!

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:17.740
No, it's not.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:24.260
The Absolute First Strike Authority?

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:27.980
So it's you, Paper Noise!

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:34.660
So she got away...

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:36.060
No matter.

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:40.420
There is one other person who needs to be destroyed.

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:53.420
It looks like you are still alive.

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:56.680
Yeah... Somehow.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:00.180
The one who saved me earlier was...

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.280
Paper Noise, probably.

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:08.140
Natsuki-chan... you're hurt.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:11.080
This is just a transient vessel, so I'm fine.

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:14.060
But I can no longer use my full strength like this.

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:16.920
That damn Priestess of Abel sure did a number on me.

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:21.060
Abel's...? That ghost-like woman?

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:22.240
That's right.

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:27.860
I heard that she was brought over to Itogami Island, and we have been trying to find her.

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:31.640
But the search was blunted by the people who are supporting Meiga.

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:35.140
So the one who is controlling the Cleansing now is...

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:38.140
It's not Aiba Asagi, but that woman.

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:42.940
She was caught up in a Cleansing once in the past, and lost her life.

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:46.960
Due to that, her ability to withstand changes to the world is very powerful.

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:54.480
That is why she has the power to control the Cleansing, even though she's not truly the Priestess of Cain.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:57.900
What the hell is the Cleansing, anyway?

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:03.720
Why did Itogami Senra and the Sinful God's faction try to recreate it?

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:06.560
If you want to know, ask a specialist.

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:09.680
It's me, Tomb Raider.

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:12.560
Oh it's you, Sensei-chan.

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:14.620
What's with the sudden phone call?

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:16.380
I'm still in the hospital, you know?

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:18.840
This voice, could it be...?

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:20.000
My dad?

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.120
I have a question for you.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:24.300
What is the Cleansing?

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:26.360
Why was it carried out?

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:29.500
What, is that all?

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:32.400
That's obvious, isn't it?

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:35.940
A large-scale massacre of demons, carried out by humans.

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:39.020
Humanity carried out a massacre of demons?

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:42.480
They weren't known by that name back then.

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:45.970
They were known as "Devas", "Ancient Superhumans"...

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:49.980
Or simply, "Gods."

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:55.120
Assuming that a person or entity called Cain once existed,

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:57.920
he was also once counted among the gods.

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:02.600
But for some reason, he was banished from this world.

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:07.480
And then, in the world that Cain was banished to, he met "humanity".

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:09.980
In other words, our ancestors.

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:17.460
He tamed humanity, gathered worshipers, and became a bona fide god.

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:21.320
And then, what do you think Cain wished for next?

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.960
Returning to this world, the one he had been banished from,

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:28.440
and revenge against the Gods who had cast him aside, huh?

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:30.540
Correct.

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:36.840
And so, Cain provided the weak humans with knowledge and tools to fight against the Gods.

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:38.620
One of those was magic.

00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:40.100
And as for the other...

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.520
Magical artifacts of Cleansing, huh?

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:46.040
But, even so, the Gods are almighty.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:48.820
Humans cannot kill Gods at a whim.

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:51.260
That's how the world works.

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:54.780
Exactly, which is why Cain thought thus;

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:58.300
"Why not just change how the world works?"

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:03.420
And so, Cain fashioned the ultimate spell, a formula to change the world itself.

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:07.840
He changed the very nature of the Gods, turning them into demons.

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:12.700
Even though humans cannot kill Gods, that doesn't apply to demons.

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:17.700
And so, what took place was a large-scale massacre of the Gods.

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:20.240
In other words, The Cleansing.

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:22.240
How do we stop it?

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:26.640
Huh? I don't care who you are, but that's a stupid question.

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:31.080
The Cleansing was carried out, and the Gods were massacred,

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:34.080
But even Cain, the one who started it all, is no longer around.

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:37.840
Which means that, even Cain himself was ultimately killed.

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:42.160
He was killed by an existence created by a sect of divinity called the Devas,

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:47.620
one that they had created and bestowed immense powers upon, for killing Gods.

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:50.320
The strongest vampire in the world.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.340
In other words, that fool called the Fourth Primogenitor.

00:10:55.940 --> 00:10:57.760
Is that all you wanted? I'm hanging up.

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:00.220
Making me talk about all this useless crap...

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:03.400
Don't die, you idiot.

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.300
Boyfriend-dono!

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:16.980
So you are in good health!

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:20.720
Oh? This atmosphere...

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.600
Did something happen?

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:25.220
It's nothing, don't worry.

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:27.800
More importantly, is Kirasaka okay?

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:29.580
About that...

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:33.380
I don't know if her state can be called "okay"-

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:35.860
Ah, Akatsuki Kojou!

00:11:36.240 --> 00:11:39.500
Where did you go, leaving me all alone?

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:41.740
If even you were to disappear...

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:46.220
I... I...

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:50.060
You stink of booze!

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:52.460
It's Itogami Meiga's doing.

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:54.920
The poison mist that he released...

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:57.660
It appears to have been ethyl alcohol.

00:11:58.260 --> 00:11:59.980
Ethyl... Wait, that's booze!

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:01.920
It wasn't poison?

00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:05.520
Alcohol, in large quantities, makes for a perfectly good poison.

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:09.220
In any case, the War Dancer-dono has been in this state ever since then...

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:12.260
Yukina!

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:14.100
No, Yukina!

00:12:14.220 --> 00:12:17.900
Don't disappear! Don't leave me behind!

00:12:18.260 --> 00:12:20.800
Natsuki-chan, can't you do something about this?

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:23.360
Just let her be. More importantly...

00:12:24.920 --> 00:12:26.400
Ouch!

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:28.720
What the hell was that for!?

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:29.980
Himeragi Yukina.

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:34.600
Take this moron and that drunkard and leave the island.

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:37.300
Are you telling us to run away?

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:42.280
As you heard on the phone, if the Cleansing activates completely,

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:45.040
the only one who can stop it is this idiot over here.

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:46.900
Protect him as best you can.

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:48.340
Also, Tank Rider.

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:49.460
Help me out.

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:54.500
Itogami Meiga activating the Cleansing, and the presence of the Priestess of Abel.

00:12:54.980 --> 00:12:58.740
Both of these things were probably not a part of the mastermind's plans.

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:01.000
We can take advantage of that.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:07.040
We need to decentralize the supercomputer that they are using, the one that regulates Itogami Island.

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:10.180
Just doing that should reduce Meiga's power.

00:13:10.840 --> 00:13:12.300
Understood!

00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:14.180
Natsuki-chan! Lydianne!

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:16.100
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:20.540
Look at me.

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:22.160
Kirasaka...

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:26.100
Akatsuki Kojou... Am I cute?

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:28.620
Huh? Yeah, I think you're cute.

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:30.160
So hurry up and cover yourself.

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:31.080
No!

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:33.760
If you really think I'm cute...

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:36.900
Then drink my blood!

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:39.820
Huh? Kirasaka... You...

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:45.380
I can't just leave you covered in... wounds like... that...

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.600
Wait, you're just going to sleep!?

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:54.040
What were you planning on doing to Sayaka-san if she hadn't fallen asleep?

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:56.040
W-Well, about that...

00:13:56.380 --> 00:14:00.100
Geez... Senpai, you're a really lewd person, aren't you?

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:03.260
Himeragi!

00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:04.940
Even you?

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:08.020
I'm just doing this instead of Sayaka-san.

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:11.820
You're going to save everyone, aren't you?

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:15.960
Then you need to recover some strength, even if only a little.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:19.480
But Himeragi... You are...

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:21.420
It's fine.

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:26.900
This might be the last time that I get to give you my blood, Senpai.

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:34.880
S-Senpai?

00:14:35.480 --> 00:14:36.980
That's no good, Himeragi.

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:38.660
It's not the last time.

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:45.220
If you disappear, Kirasaka, Kanase, Nagisa, and even I would be sad.

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:49.040
Don't give up until the end, for our sake as well!

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:56.220
But then I won't be able to stand at your side, Senpai.

00:14:57.180 --> 00:14:59.680
If I stop being a Sword Shaman...

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:01.060
You can still stay with me!

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:06.860
Even if you're not a Sword Shaman of the Lion King Organization, or an observer...

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:09.980
If you want to live on this island, then do just that!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:12.940
It's fine for you to stay here!

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:23.140
I...

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:28.400
I don't want to leave either!

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:37.540
The days I've spent since coming to this island are as precious as gold to me.

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:40.580
So...

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:48.060
Senpai, please take my blood.

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:51.420
I'm your observer, after all.

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:53.800
Until the end, forever.

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:56.340
Himeragi...

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:06.960
Go deeper...

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:11.280
Don't let me go!

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:13.380
Senpai!

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:16.800
Akatsuki-senpai!

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.560
My goodness.

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:26.140
Just when I thought that I had finally found you...

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:28.620
What are you doing in a place like this?

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:30.160
Y-You are...

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:32.200
Shike-sama! I..!

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:34.120
I won't try to stop you anymore.

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:36.200
In return, Fourth Primogenitor...

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:39.800
You are going to take responsibility properly.

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:42.560
Put this on Yukina's finger.

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:45.120
A ring?

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:49.940
If things go well, that ring will stop Yukina from turning into an angel.

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:51.220
Got it.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:01.220
I don't really see any difference...

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.800
It's something like a good-luck charm.

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:07.020
I'll just pray that it works out well.

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:13.620
Senpai!

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:15.240
Itogami Meiga, huh?

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:16.820
Help.

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:20.000
Save this city.

00:17:20.460 --> 00:17:21.300
Kojou.

00:17:24.220 --> 00:17:25.800
So you were here after all.

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:27.420
Yaze Akishige.

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.680
Minamiya Natsuki...

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:31.700
The Witch of the Void, huh?

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:35.120
Not only did you fake your death, but all this sneaking around...

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:37.760
Are you planning on releasing Cain's Coffin

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:41.060
and consigning the Priestess to the bottom of the sea, casket and all?

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:43.880
As long as the altar, the man-made island, is safe

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:45.880
we can do redo this as many times as we need.

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:49.400
Are you here to stop me?

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:51.120
Witch of the Void?

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:55.280
No, I will refrain.

00:17:55.560 --> 00:17:58.480
It looks like I don't need to do anything, after all.

00:17:59.100 --> 00:18:00.200
What?

00:18:04.940 --> 00:18:07.000
Itogami Meiga, huh?

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:14.440
What are you planning, you undead grunt?

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:17.460
Hell Wolf... what are you planning?

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:21.300
The complete resurrection of the Sinful God, Cain.

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:22.860
Have you gone insane?

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:27.300
Resurrecting Cain himself... You'll destroy the world!

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:29.860
Why, that is indeed our goal.

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:34.780
With the Sinful God Cain's power, the Cleansing will travel along the ley lines,

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:37.900
and cover the entire planet.

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:42.520
We will take as many people down to hell with us as we can...

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:46.520
That is the true purpose of our Cleansing!

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:51.840
Will you be next, Minamiya Natsuki?

00:18:52.380 --> 00:18:56.000
Or will you just run away using the teleportation that you're so good at?

00:18:57.280 --> 00:19:00.020
I am not the one who needs to run.

00:19:00.220 --> 00:19:02.520
That would be you, Itogami Meiga.

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:04.760
Regulus Aurum!

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:11.260
I'm here to end the Cleansing, Itogami Meiga!

00:19:11.640 --> 00:19:12.660
I already told you!

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:15.260
You are no threat to me!

00:19:15.560 --> 00:19:16.440
Get lost!

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:19.240
Yeah, maybe you're right about me.

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:21.760
But how about Asagi?

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:23.400
What are you talking about?

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:26.700
Itogami Meiga... And the Priestess of Abel.

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:30.220
The two of you are not actually controlling the Cleansing.

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:33.520
If you were, you wouldn't come to this control room.

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:40.000
You had to, because Asagi has been protecting the contents of the casket, Cain's wisdom, all this time.

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:45.140
All this time, she has been protecting the island on her own!

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:49.300
As expected of Itogami Island's idol!

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:52.000
So what?

00:19:52.240 --> 00:19:58.500
I can take my time dealing with her resistance after I finish destroying all of you!

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:04.160
No, your revenge ends here.

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:08.460
Because Asagi gave us a chance.

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:11.860
Now... Let's do this, Itogami Meiga.

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:15.880
From now on, this is my fight!

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:20.520
No, Senpai. This is our fight!

00:20:21.020 --> 00:20:24.740
How many times... How many times must you get in my way!?

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:26.320
Himeragi Yukina!

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:27.360
Sekkarou!

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:32.880
Come out, Cor Tauri-Sucinum!

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:35.100
Popess!

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:42.740
So I was right after all.

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:46.960
Fangzahn can negate both magic and spiritual energy.

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:51.040
Why was such a fearsome weapon labeled as a failure?

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:56.860
That's because it can only negate either one of those things at a time.

00:20:58.060 --> 00:21:00.380
So what if you realized that?

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:05.620
I can make up for that weakness by using it in conjunction with the Cleansing!

00:21:06.020 --> 00:21:09.500
You people have no chance of winning!

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:11.120
That's not true!

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:15.180
Come out, Tenth Familiar! Dabih-Crystallus!

00:21:17.140 --> 00:21:22.460
Sadalmelik-Albus! Al-Nasl-Minium! Kiffa-Ater!

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:27.040
Such foolishness.

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:28.460
I'm not done!

00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:34.820
Come out, Regulus-Aurum! Natra-Cinereus! Mesarthim-Adamas!

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:37.380
Using so many familiars at once...

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:41.400
There is no way your psyche will be able to withstand it for long!

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:45.820
Akatsuki Kojou! As I thought, you are no match for me!

00:21:47.180 --> 00:21:49.940
Yeah, if Himeragi and I were your only opponents.

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:52.620
Let's do this, Mogwai!

00:21:53.560 --> 00:21:55.240
Roger that, Missy!

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:05.020
Sorry to keep you waiting, Empress-dono!

00:22:05.280 --> 00:22:06.400
Seriously!

00:22:06.540 --> 00:22:10.540
Well, thanks to that, I had plenty of time to make preparations for my revenge!

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:20.240
So this is the power of the real Priestess of Cain...

00:22:20.800 --> 00:22:27.040
Fourth Primogenitor... All your attacks were just to set the stage for this counterattack!?

00:22:27.520 --> 00:22:30.060
It's over, Itogami Meiga!

00:22:33.300 --> 00:22:37.100
I, Sword Shaman of the High God and priestess of the Lion, beseech thee.

00:22:37.260 --> 00:22:43.700
I, Akatsuki Kojou, successor to the blood of "Kaleid Blood", now release your constraints.

00:22:43.940 --> 00:22:46.440
Dawn light of exorcism, spirit wolf of snowy mist,

00:22:46.640 --> 00:22:50.700
grant me the divine might of thy steel, that I may smite a hundred evil spirits!

00:22:50.840 --> 00:22:53.700
Come out! Al-Meissa-Mercury!

00:23:06.700 --> 00:23:07.880
Touka...

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:11.880
Is it over?

00:23:16.380 --> 00:23:17.140
Himeragi!

00:23:17.340 --> 00:23:18.580
Pull yourself together!

00:23:18.720 --> 00:23:22.200
Weren't you going to keep observing me from now on!?

00:23:23.120 --> 00:23:26.040
I'm sorry... But...

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:32.800
I'm just so hungry...

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:33.900
Huh?

00:23:34.560 --> 00:23:36.560
What about your angel transformation?

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:39.520
Phase-shifting into a higher dimension and disappearing?

00:23:39.620 --> 00:23:41.780
I'm fine... I think.

00:23:42.000 --> 00:23:44.260
Looks like it worked out.

00:23:45.040 --> 00:23:49.280
Now Yukina is your blood servant.

00:23:49.740 --> 00:23:51.000
Blood servant?

00:23:51.220 --> 00:23:52.520
Your blood companion.

00:23:52.800 --> 00:23:54.980
You could also call her your bride.

00:23:55.320 --> 00:23:58.840
A pseudo-vampire, given a share of immortality from their master.

00:23:59.180 --> 00:24:04.340
Well, to be exact, all I did was to use that ring to link your spiritual passes.

00:24:04.480 --> 00:24:08.200
So she's not completely your bride, but more of a fiancee.

00:24:08.600 --> 00:24:12.080
Our spiritual passes... How did you do that?

00:24:12.400 --> 00:24:16.940
The thing on Yukina's finger contains a shard that came from your ribs.

00:24:17.080 --> 00:24:19.100
My ribs!? When did you get that...

00:24:19.480 --> 00:24:21.680
Ah... Back then?

00:24:22.200 --> 00:24:24.480
Shike-sama... I...!

00:24:24.740 --> 00:24:29.120
You will be continuing your observation of the Fourth Primogenitor for quite a while yet.

00:24:30.220 --> 00:24:34.860
The Lion King Organization does not have the leeway to feed freeloaders.

00:24:35.060 --> 00:24:35.980
Yes!

00:24:38.080 --> 00:24:39.260
Yaze Akishige.

00:24:39.900 --> 00:24:44.220
By the authority of the Lion King Organization, I am taking you into custody.

00:24:45.540 --> 00:24:48.340
Do you really think you can do that?

00:24:48.540 --> 00:24:53.300
Had you still been the Chairman of the Yaze Conglomerate, it might have been impossible.

00:24:54.440 --> 00:25:00.980
A new leader was selected at the Conference of Elders a short while ago, to replace the deceased previous head.

00:25:01.360 --> 00:25:03.700
The new family head is Motoki.

00:25:05.200 --> 00:25:09.700
Do you think you fools can actually head this Demon District?

00:25:09.900 --> 00:25:13.840
The darkness that this island bears is synonymous with the darkness of humanity itself!

00:25:13.980 --> 00:25:18.000
I will take those words as your last testament and keep them in mind, Father.

00:25:32.060 --> 00:25:34.820
Why on Earth do I need to sneak around like this?

00:25:34.980 --> 00:25:37.560
Didn't you see what happened at that restaurant earlier?

00:25:37.760 --> 00:25:39.140
You're a celebrity!

00:25:39.520 --> 00:25:40.980
Just deal with it for a while.

00:25:44.040 --> 00:25:47.900
I've been meaning to ask for a while... What's with the ring?

00:25:48.420 --> 00:25:50.020
About this, well...

00:25:50.300 --> 00:25:53.900
Akatsuki-senpai put it on my finger, and now it won't come off.

00:25:54.040 --> 00:25:55.060
What!?

00:25:55.560 --> 00:25:57.040
What the heck does this mean, Kojou!?

00:25:57.160 --> 00:25:58.820
Calm down. You see...

00:25:58.980 --> 00:26:01.240
Ah, there she is! Yukina-chan!

00:26:01.860 --> 00:26:03.820
Are you feeling okay?

00:26:04.240 --> 00:26:07.540
I'm on your side no matter what happens, okay?

00:26:07.620 --> 00:26:08.880
N-Nagisa-chan!?

00:26:09.240 --> 00:26:13.280
Sure, I don't really want to be called "Aunt" at my age, but...

00:26:13.480 --> 00:26:16.440
But I'm sure your baby will be cute, Yukina-chan!

00:26:16.640 --> 00:26:18.360
I'm totally okay with it!

00:26:18.480 --> 00:26:20.520
More importantly, what should we name the baby?

00:26:20.660 --> 00:26:22.920
Is it a boy? Or a girl?

00:26:23.300 --> 00:26:24.880
B-Baby?

00:26:25.120 --> 00:26:27.560
Nagisa? What exactly are you talking about?

00:26:27.700 --> 00:26:29.720
Kojou-kun, you idiot! Beast!

00:26:29.960 --> 00:26:32.160
I heard the whole story from Kirasaka-san!

00:26:32.300 --> 00:26:35.820
Yukina-chan's body is in terrible condition because of you,

00:26:35.940 --> 00:26:38.280
and when she did a check-up, it turned out to be positive!

00:26:38.380 --> 00:26:41.380
Speaking of which, she hasn't been eating much lately...

00:26:41.580 --> 00:26:43.700
What's the meaning of this, Kojou!?

00:26:43.820 --> 00:26:45.300
The test came back positive...!?

00:26:45.380 --> 00:26:48.320
Don't tell me, that ring is your way of saying you'll take responsibility!?

00:26:49.200 --> 00:26:51.080
Himeragi, help me out here!

00:26:51.220 --> 00:26:52.320
Listen to me, dammit!

00:26:52.440 --> 00:26:54.420
It's not what you think!

00:28:31.280 --> 00:28:34.300
How unsightly, Itogami Meiga.

00:28:34.940 --> 00:28:40.380
It turned out to be a disappointing result for you, but I had a great deal of fun.

00:28:45.000 --> 00:28:46.960
The Cleansing... Yes.

00:28:47.180 --> 00:28:51.360
This is a power that is worth being consumed by me.

00:28:51.700 --> 00:28:53.500
Dimitrie Vatler...

00:28:54.120 --> 00:28:56.060
So this was your plan all along!

00:29:03.940 --> 00:29:05.940
Now the stage is set.

00:29:06.500 --> 00:29:09.520
Now, let us begin the final banquet.

00:29:10.540 --> 00:29:12.480
Won't you join me in this beautiful dance?

00:29:12.940 --> 00:29:14.480
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:29:15.040 --> 00:29:18.760
Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful!
